WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 7]

01:34.540 --> 01:36.060
I drew these for fun

01:36.900 --> 01:38.880
when I had free time.

01:38.900 --> 01:40.860
Then why didn't you draw the face?

01:41.260 --> 01:42.620
Do you want me to ask further

01:42.620 --> 01:44.420
whose face these are supposed to be?

01:45.540 --> 01:47.300
You are the Crown Prince!

01:48.100 --> 01:49.340
I'm sorry.

01:50.540 --> 01:52.700
I will obey what you say, Mother.

01:53.460 --> 01:54.860
I won't draw again.

02:48.020 --> 02:50.420
What about the Shijia Town?

02:50.620 --> 02:52.180
Chengze was alerted.

02:53.060 --> 02:54.740
By the time my men arrived,

02:54.900 --> 02:56.580
his men had already retreated.

02:57.180 --> 02:59.140
They didn't leave any evidence
in the town.

03:00.340 --> 03:02.980
If so, why did you burn down the town?

03:03.780 --> 03:05.700
Because Fan Xian is a good man.

03:06.460 --> 03:08.300
Only if I burned the town to the ground

03:09.140 --> 03:11.580
would he be driven apart from Chengze

03:12.340 --> 03:14.300
and firmly take my side.

03:16.740 --> 03:19.180
All the more reason
he can't find out the truth.

03:19.460 --> 03:20.980
Don't worry, Mother.

03:21.780 --> 03:23.980
Except for a lunatic,

03:24.340 --> 03:25.760
no one would do such an atrocious

03:25.780 --> 03:27.900
and vile deed

03:28.660 --> 03:30.260
for no reason.

03:30.340 --> 03:31.760
There is only one truth.

03:31.780 --> 03:34.540
Chengze wiped out the town.

03:38.620 --> 03:40.580
Why do you value Fan Xian so much?

03:43.180 --> 03:44.900
No one would turn down a good man.

04:09.500 --> 04:10.580
Mr. Fan.

04:14.780 --> 04:17.220
I have been waiting for you.

04:19.460 --> 04:20.920
Didn't I ask you to go home
and consider it?

04:20.940 --> 04:22.900
There would only be dangers
if you follow me.

04:23.380 --> 04:24.680
I have thought it through.

04:24.700 --> 04:25.560
That's quick.

04:25.580 --> 04:27.000
There is not much to consider.

04:27.020 --> 04:28.040
My wife said

04:28.060 --> 04:30.440
I could make this much money
in a month,

04:30.460 --> 04:32.420
which no other place could offer.

04:33.580 --> 04:34.660
One more thing.

04:35.020 --> 04:36.100
You are

04:36.580 --> 04:37.980
a good man.

04:53.260 --> 04:55.040
What's the point of being a good man

04:55.060 --> 04:56.780
when dangers surround me?

04:57.460 --> 04:58.540
Mr. Fan,

04:58.780 --> 05:01.340
dangers lurk everywhere,

05:01.380 --> 05:03.660
but good men are few and far between.

05:03.940 --> 05:05.340
Speaking of which,

05:05.940 --> 05:07.900
what kind of good man am I?

05:08.140 --> 05:10.020
There are enough things wrong with me.

05:10.500 --> 05:11.780
I'm cowardly,

05:11.940 --> 05:13.100
selfish,

05:13.140 --> 05:15.020
greedy, and vain.

05:15.140 --> 05:17.120
I'm at times resistant to change

05:17.140 --> 05:19.100
and indecisive.

05:20.180 --> 05:21.540
In all honesty,

05:22.020 --> 05:23.980
I'm just an ordinary man.

05:24.500 --> 05:26.540
What will an ordinary man do

05:26.900 --> 05:28.100
in this situation?

05:28.260 --> 05:29.440
What will they do?

05:29.460 --> 05:31.340
They quit!

05:33.460 --> 05:34.380
I'm no longer the inspector,

05:34.380 --> 05:35.800
and the trail has gone cold.

05:35.820 --> 05:37.540
I can't continue the investigation.

05:37.580 --> 05:39.340
Why should I continue?

05:40.380 --> 05:42.020
How is that my concern?

05:42.500 --> 05:46.780
People should learn
how to keep their hands clean.

05:46.900 --> 05:47.980
Mr. Fan,

05:48.020 --> 05:50.240
please don't be discouraged.

05:50.260 --> 05:51.980
Your dispositions and stances

05:52.140 --> 05:54.660
have already changed many people.

05:54.940 --> 05:55.920
Who?

05:55.940 --> 05:57.540
At least, there is me,

05:58.020 --> 05:59.420
Wang Qinian.

06:08.820 --> 06:12.140
It seems that you haven't figured out
His Majesty's intention.

06:17.580 --> 06:18.700
I did.

06:19.580 --> 06:20.900
He took my official token away

06:20.900 --> 06:22.380
[Imperial Inspectorate]

06:22.380 --> 06:24.420
and appointed a marriage
between Li Chengze and the Ye family.

06:24.420 --> 06:27.100
Everyone knows that the Ye family
is protected by a Grandmaster.

06:27.180 --> 06:28.600
Once they get married,

06:28.620 --> 06:31.900
Li Chengze will have a promising future.

06:33.580 --> 06:34.780
His Majesty

06:35.260 --> 06:36.660
is protecting him.

06:42.140 --> 06:43.680
He thinks it's unfair.

06:43.700 --> 06:45.040
I can't afford that thought.

06:45.060 --> 06:45.900
What's his identity?

06:45.900 --> 06:47.220
And what is mine?

06:47.820 --> 06:50.220
It's a given
that His Majesty protects his own son.

06:50.940 --> 06:53.220
So you are not going to continue
the investigation?

06:54.500 --> 06:57.540
Mr. Chen, how am I going to continue?

06:57.940 --> 06:59.000
The prince broke the law.

06:59.020 --> 07:00.800
I risked my life to advise the emperor.

07:00.820 --> 07:02.020
He refused to listen.

07:02.580 --> 07:04.360
Fine, I obeyed him.

07:04.380 --> 07:05.360
Now, I came back here alive

07:05.380 --> 07:07.120
to tell him the hard truth again,

07:07.140 --> 07:09.220
but he still deflected the topic.

07:10.260 --> 07:11.780
Is anything I say useful?

07:12.500 --> 07:14.860
Who can I trust in this world?

07:15.260 --> 07:16.900
Can I trust him?

07:17.140 --> 07:18.780
Can I trust you?

07:19.780 --> 07:22.220
It doesn't matter
whether you trust me or not.

07:26.820 --> 07:29.220
[Inspector]
I brought this back for you.

07:37.020 --> 07:38.980
His Majesty threw it into the water.

07:39.260 --> 07:41.340
But did he ever mention dismissing you?

07:42.340 --> 07:44.500
Everyone can see that what His Majesty
had said earlier today

07:44.500 --> 07:46.540
was to protect Li Chengze.

07:46.580 --> 07:48.220
So, from now on,

07:48.380 --> 07:50.420
this matter is considered over.

07:53.020 --> 07:54.340
That's a subtle hint.

07:54.460 --> 07:57.900
His Majesty wants me to lie low
and find something in the undercurrent.

07:59.260 --> 08:00.380
No wonder he threw it into the water.

08:00.380 --> 08:01.900
Don't read too much into it.

08:01.940 --> 08:03.220
You are going too far.

08:03.580 --> 08:05.340
Anyway, you got the right message.

08:05.580 --> 08:07.040
But the Shijia Town is gone.

08:07.060 --> 08:08.460
If you don't calm yourself down,

08:08.460 --> 08:10.700
more towns will end up like Shijia Town.

08:10.780 --> 08:12.360
The priority now is,

08:12.380 --> 08:14.660
do you really know
who you are up against?

08:15.500 --> 08:17.220
Have you ever considered

08:17.500 --> 08:19.220
your future actions?

08:22.580 --> 08:24.020
Who I'm against

08:26.060 --> 08:27.540
is Li Chengze

08:28.460 --> 08:30.420
and people of his kind.

08:41.780 --> 08:43.260
I'm not my mother.

08:44.300 --> 08:46.940
I can't live by the goal
of changing this world.

08:49.380 --> 08:51.020
But at least

08:51.420 --> 08:52.780
in this life,

08:53.500 --> 08:55.900
I want to be a good man
I identify myself to be

08:56.500 --> 08:58.020
and live with a conscience

08:58.260 --> 08:59.780
I'm comfortable with.

09:02.620 --> 09:03.500
I hate to see

09:03.500 --> 09:05.400
unjust deaths like Teng Zijing's,

09:05.420 --> 09:06.260
nor do I want to witness

09:06.260 --> 09:08.780
defenseless people like Jin.

09:10.500 --> 09:11.940
I want to speak up for them.

09:12.780 --> 09:15.940
I want to seek justice
for those who die aggrieved.

09:17.740 --> 09:20.060
That's why you must calm down,

09:20.860 --> 09:22.280
lie low,

09:22.300 --> 09:23.660
and start over.

09:25.380 --> 09:28.280
Although the inspector
of the Imperial Inspectorate is powerful,

09:28.300 --> 09:29.820
you are on your own.

09:29.860 --> 09:31.480
You have been in the Capital
for some time.

09:31.500 --> 09:33.640
You should have your own team.

09:33.660 --> 09:34.760
I have Wang Qinian.

09:34.780 --> 09:35.860
Not enough.

09:36.020 --> 09:37.200
Do you remember Zhu Ge?

09:37.220 --> 09:38.240
I won't forget him.

09:38.260 --> 09:39.080
After Zhu Ge's passing,

09:39.100 --> 09:41.220
the First Division
has been without a leader.

09:41.660 --> 09:43.300
I suggest you

09:44.380 --> 09:48.240
take up his position.

09:48.260 --> 09:51.400
The First Division monitors
the officials in the Capital,

09:51.420 --> 09:52.960
which involves complicated parties.

09:52.980 --> 09:54.860
This is a place of trouble

09:54.860 --> 09:56.480
and fierce battles.

09:56.500 --> 09:57.900
Just now, you said

09:58.140 --> 10:00.140
you wanted to speak up for the people

10:00.500 --> 10:02.260
and bring Li Chengze down.

10:02.860 --> 10:04.060
This position

10:05.060 --> 10:06.300
is the best choice.

10:18.540 --> 10:19.660
Mr. Chen,

10:20.500 --> 10:22.300
I heard something

10:22.500 --> 10:24.020
during the trip to Northern Qi.

10:24.980 --> 10:26.060
It's good.

10:27.880 --> 10:29.300
You got to see the real world.

10:29.740 --> 10:30.900
Is my life

10:30.900 --> 10:32.760
controlled by you all?

10:32.780 --> 10:35.060
If I say I'm helping you,

10:35.100 --> 10:36.300
would you believe me?

10:36.660 --> 10:38.260
Do I have the guts to believe you?

10:48.380 --> 10:50.260
After all, you are her son.

10:53.500 --> 10:55.660
There is something
I have been meaning to ask.

10:55.900 --> 10:56.980
Go on.

10:58.100 --> 10:59.660
If one day

11:00.780 --> 11:02.880
I pick a different path
from my mother's,

11:02.900 --> 11:03.620
who would you choose?

11:03.620 --> 11:04.360
Impossible.

11:04.380 --> 11:05.640
What if it were true?

11:05.660 --> 11:07.420
I would definitely choose your mother.

11:10.420 --> 11:12.780
In the end, you all help me

11:13.780 --> 11:15.660
because I'm her son.

11:16.380 --> 11:17.540
Exactly.

11:20.900 --> 11:22.420
Then you will be disappointed.

11:23.500 --> 11:25.740
I'm not the same as my mother.

11:25.900 --> 11:28.120
You should know
there is no one alike in this world.

11:28.140 --> 11:30.420
But you and your mother

11:31.620 --> 11:34.140
are the same in nature.

11:35.180 --> 11:36.560
I wouldn't dare to erupt this monument.

11:36.580 --> 11:38.820
It doesn't matter
whether you erupt a monument or not.

11:38.900 --> 11:42.780
Listen, you will surely walk the same path
as your mother in the future.

11:43.100 --> 11:44.140
Besides, I'm now trying

11:44.140 --> 11:45.660
to make sure

11:45.740 --> 11:48.540
you will walk the path you choose.

11:50.140 --> 11:51.900
I have been manipulated all my life,

11:52.020 --> 11:54.500
yet I have to make sure
I walk the path I choose,

11:54.740 --> 11:56.140
isn't that absurd?

11:56.380 --> 11:58.660
To gain, you must first give.
This isn't absurd.

12:07.460 --> 12:09.420
Have you thought this through
long ago?

12:09.500 --> 12:11.360
I have told you.

12:11.380 --> 12:12.800
Whatever you want to do,

12:12.820 --> 12:14.380
I will always be there for you.

12:14.420 --> 12:16.060
I may have deceived you before,

12:16.100 --> 12:17.840
but I mean what I'm saying now.

12:17.860 --> 12:19.600
Is there anything else
you are keeping from me?

12:19.620 --> 12:20.740
Of course, there is.

12:20.780 --> 12:22.180
But I can't tell you.

12:22.260 --> 12:23.480
Can I still trust you?

12:23.500 --> 12:24.740
Yes,

12:25.380 --> 12:26.900
but not completely.

12:27.060 --> 12:28.900
You can never tell with people,
after all.

12:31.900 --> 12:34.270
[Inspector]

12:38.140 --> 12:39.420
If so,

12:40.020 --> 12:41.420
I will trust you halfway.

12:41.580 --> 12:42.740
That's too much.

12:46.540 --> 12:48.420
Is this the old one?

13:01.220 --> 13:03.500
The person eager to see you more
than I am has come.

13:14.580 --> 13:16.820
Leave no loose ends
on the Baoyue Pleasure House.

13:17.540 --> 13:18.620
I know.

13:21.260 --> 13:22.540
What brings you here?

13:28.780 --> 13:30.000
This is Fan Xian.

13:30.020 --> 13:32.420
His surname is Fan. He is my son.

13:33.780 --> 13:34.560
I know.

13:34.580 --> 13:36.200
No one wants to take him away from you.

13:36.220 --> 13:38.620
What is the highest virtue
in the Qing State's culture?

13:38.780 --> 13:40.180
Is it filial piety?

13:40.380 --> 13:42.880
Have you heard of familial love?

13:42.900 --> 13:43.600
I did.

13:43.620 --> 13:45.960
The first people he met after traveling
all the way back to the Capital

13:45.960 --> 13:47.840
were His Majesty and you.

13:47.860 --> 13:49.260
This is ridiculous.

13:52.900 --> 13:54.600
Why is he so angry?

13:54.620 --> 13:55.940
I'm not angry.

13:56.380 --> 13:57.660
Why would I be?

13:58.140 --> 13:59.820
I'm reasoning with you.

13:59.980 --> 14:02.220
Let me ask you this.
After returning from a long journey,

14:02.220 --> 14:04.140
Fan Xian didn't first return home
to pay respects to the family.

14:04.140 --> 14:05.760
Isn't this against
the teaching of filial piety?

14:05.760 --> 14:07.000
If this gets out,

14:07.020 --> 14:09.020
will the Ministry of Rites
criticize him?

14:10.500 --> 14:12.900
You are right. They will.

14:14.660 --> 14:16.940
Finally, you admit you are wrong.

14:20.740 --> 14:22.480
But I didn't summon him here.

14:22.500 --> 14:23.780
Not you?

14:23.860 --> 14:27.300
Actually, I came here myself.

14:28.500 --> 14:30.380
I wanted to wipe this monument.

14:48.980 --> 14:50.060
Let's go home.

14:51.980 --> 14:53.300
You are riding with me.

15:08.300 --> 15:09.500
Please have some tea.

15:19.500 --> 15:22.540
Don't fuss over
what happened in the palace.

15:23.420 --> 15:25.360
Even though His Majesty
got rid of your token,

15:25.380 --> 15:26.760
he didn't issue an order.

15:26.780 --> 15:28.900
To remove me
from the position of inspector.

15:29.220 --> 15:30.360
Mr. Chen told me about that.

15:30.380 --> 15:31.760
This is the Capital.

15:31.780 --> 15:33.540
It's not a battle between two fighters.

15:34.620 --> 15:36.520
If you want to compete
with the Second Prince,

15:36.540 --> 15:38.200
don't do it yourself.

15:38.220 --> 15:40.140
I need to cultivate my own team.

15:40.380 --> 15:41.840
Mr. Chen told me about that too.

15:41.860 --> 15:43.840
Afterward, I will take up the position
in the First Division.

15:43.860 --> 15:46.120
I know Mr. Chen is helping you.

15:46.140 --> 15:47.780
But this is the Capital.

15:48.100 --> 15:49.720
You ought to be careful.

15:49.740 --> 15:50.880
I can trust Mr. Chen,

15:50.900 --> 15:52.280
but not completely.

15:52.300 --> 15:53.900
You can never tell with people.

15:54.020 --> 15:55.540
He mentioned this as well.

15:56.740 --> 15:58.820
How generous of him.

15:59.300 --> 16:00.880
But there is one thing
I don't hold with.

16:00.900 --> 16:01.980
Which one?

16:03.020 --> 16:04.540
You can never tell with people.

16:04.900 --> 16:06.140
For others,

16:06.380 --> 16:08.020
I can't trust them completely.

16:10.900 --> 16:12.820
But not my family.

16:22.540 --> 16:24.620
Those fellows in the Ministry of Rites

16:24.780 --> 16:27.360
always make a fuss about filial piety.

16:27.380 --> 16:30.000
I hurried here
not because you didn't pay me respect.

16:30.020 --> 16:32.300
I'm afraid you might mistrust people

16:32.500 --> 16:34.420
in the court.

16:34.780 --> 16:36.380
Father, thank you for your wise advice.

16:36.380 --> 16:37.600
I'm so enlightened

16:37.620 --> 16:39.020
upon hearing it.

16:39.860 --> 16:41.540
As long as you understand.

16:46.780 --> 16:49.020
I haven't visited Wan'er
since I returned here.

16:49.500 --> 16:50.580
Maybe...

16:55.020 --> 16:57.420
Maybe I should stay at home
for a few days first

16:57.540 --> 16:59.500
before I visit her.

17:00.740 --> 17:02.940
You should go back and visit Ruoruo.

17:03.140 --> 17:05.860
Your little sister has
missed you terribly.

17:20.050 --> 17:24.345
[Fan's Residence]

17:26.500 --> 17:27.580
Ruoruo.

17:29.740 --> 17:30.820
Ruoruo.

17:36.540 --> 17:37.620
Ruoruo.

18:00.180 --> 18:01.260
Ruoruo.

18:02.460 --> 18:04.760
Xian, you are finally back.

18:04.780 --> 18:06.020
Where have you been?

18:06.780 --> 18:08.020
I...

18:08.580 --> 18:10.060
I was wandering the world.

18:11.820 --> 18:13.780
Wander the world?

18:14.340 --> 18:15.540
For how long?

18:16.420 --> 18:17.760
Around

18:17.780 --> 18:19.180
fifteen minutes.

18:20.300 --> 18:23.060
That's quite a short journey.

18:23.960 --> 18:25.620
In fact,
I wasn't just wandering the world.

18:25.640 --> 18:27.280
I was trying to avoid the marriage.

18:27.300 --> 18:29.160
I heard that His Majesty appointed
a marriage for me.

18:29.180 --> 18:30.240
But I don't want it,

18:30.260 --> 18:32.300
so I packed my things and ran away.

18:32.320 --> 18:33.740
Then, why did you come back?

18:35.660 --> 18:37.060
I left in haste,

18:37.300 --> 18:39.540
and when I calmed down halfway,

18:39.660 --> 18:41.100
I came to a realization.

18:41.940 --> 18:43.020
Xian,

18:43.300 --> 18:45.040
do you know who I trust the most
in this world?

18:45.060 --> 18:46.180
Who?

18:46.260 --> 18:47.760
You, of course.

18:47.780 --> 18:49.840
So I was thinking of asking
for your opinion

18:49.860 --> 18:51.400
whether I should leave or not.

18:53.580 --> 18:56.300
What if I ask you to stay?

19:02.940 --> 19:03.760
What are you doing?

19:03.780 --> 19:04.800
Since I'm not leaving,

19:04.820 --> 19:06.620
I will put the clothes back
in the chest.

19:07.720 --> 19:10.000
Aren't you worried that I make you
follow the decree to get married?

19:10.020 --> 19:11.480
Not at all, Xian.

19:11.500 --> 19:12.320
Like I said,

19:12.340 --> 19:14.380
you are the one
I trust the most in this world.

19:15.460 --> 19:17.780
Ruoruo, you don't want to get married?

19:19.020 --> 19:20.100
No.

19:22.060 --> 19:23.180
Got it.

19:23.340 --> 19:25.100
Don't worry. I will find a way.

19:25.180 --> 19:27.300
You won't get married
if you don't want to.

19:28.500 --> 19:29.580
Sure.

19:30.540 --> 19:31.800
If things can't work out,

19:31.820 --> 19:33.060
I will take you and run.

19:33.260 --> 19:34.380
All right.

19:35.980 --> 19:38.020
Stop. You will mess up my hair.

19:38.940 --> 19:40.240
Well, continue with the unpacking.

19:40.260 --> 19:41.540
I'm off to handle Fan Sizhe's matter.

19:41.560 --> 19:42.640
Xian,

19:43.020 --> 19:44.400
you just got back.

19:44.420 --> 19:46.980
What's wrong with Fan Sizhe?
Is it a serious matter?

19:47.020 --> 19:48.000
Let me put it this way.

19:48.020 --> 19:49.860
I almost beat him to death.

19:50.700 --> 19:51.760
I have often thought that.

19:51.780 --> 19:53.060
I can help you with that.

19:53.500 --> 19:54.820
It's a misunderstanding.

19:56.300 --> 19:57.520
Well, let's do it another time, then.

19:57.540 --> 19:58.840
Don't forget to call me next time.

19:58.860 --> 20:00.400
But he is your little brother.

20:00.420 --> 20:01.520
You are my elder brother.

20:01.540 --> 20:03.240
Can't you be more fair?

20:03.260 --> 20:04.380
I can't.

20:04.980 --> 20:06.960
I may have many younger brothers
in days to come,

20:06.980 --> 20:09.260
but you are my only elder brother.

20:09.780 --> 20:11.700
That does make some sense.

20:14.540 --> 20:15.620
Ruoruo,

20:16.020 --> 20:18.260
don't worry. I won't let you down.

20:18.420 --> 20:19.700
Of course you won't.

20:36.500 --> 20:37.960
You say Fan Xian is back?

20:37.980 --> 20:38.840
Yes, Young Master.

20:38.860 --> 20:40.460
My father must be elated, right?

20:52.500 --> 20:53.880
Father, did you ask for me?

20:53.900 --> 20:55.300
Mother, you are here too.

20:55.500 --> 20:57.620
Xian, you are finally back.

20:58.500 --> 21:00.860
Why are you kneeling
before he asks anything?

21:02.700 --> 21:04.540
I sense this familiar tension.

21:05.740 --> 21:08.180
Do you know
about the Baoyue Pleasure House?

21:10.020 --> 21:10.960
I do.

21:10.980 --> 21:12.380
Who is the owner?

21:12.540 --> 21:13.400
It's me.

21:13.420 --> 21:14.820
This is simply ludicrous!

21:14.980 --> 21:16.620
How could you do that?

21:17.220 --> 21:18.300
Mother,

21:18.500 --> 21:20.220
I just wanted to make some money.

21:21.500 --> 21:24.220
You lost your character for mere money.

21:24.780 --> 21:27.260
Master, please spare him.

21:28.060 --> 21:29.140
Run.

21:29.940 --> 21:31.180
Bring torture.

21:31.420 --> 21:34.520
No need.
Actually, he is also the victim.

21:34.540 --> 21:35.440
That's right.

21:35.460 --> 21:36.760
Sizhe is never smart.

21:36.780 --> 21:38.240
Surely, he was deceived.

21:38.260 --> 21:40.520
Mother, you always call me smart.

21:40.540 --> 21:42.020
Just shut up already.

21:42.460 --> 21:44.280
Whether or not he was deceived,

21:44.300 --> 21:46.540
he must accept the punishment
for his mistake.

21:46.580 --> 21:47.800
He will be beaten

21:47.820 --> 21:49.060
no matter what.

21:49.340 --> 21:51.000
To be honest, I have already beaten him.

21:51.020 --> 21:52.980
Yes, Fan Xian already...

21:54.740 --> 21:55.860
You beat him?

21:57.020 --> 21:58.500
Did you both meet before?

21:59.780 --> 22:00.480
Yes.

22:00.500 --> 22:02.340
He almost beat me to death.

22:02.700 --> 22:04.280
Why didn't you tell me?

22:04.300 --> 22:06.000
Xian said not to tell anyone

22:06.020 --> 22:07.120
and wanted me to stay in my room.

22:07.140 --> 22:08.440
So you didn't go out these days

22:08.460 --> 22:09.860
because of Fan Xian?

22:11.340 --> 22:13.440
You have already returned
to the Capital earlier?

22:13.460 --> 22:14.780
I did come back before.

22:18.020 --> 22:19.500
What is going on?

22:29.020 --> 22:31.200
Father, it is a long story.

22:31.220 --> 22:32.700
Don't let him keep kneeling.

22:32.820 --> 22:34.060
Stand over there.

22:39.060 --> 22:40.200
Well,

22:40.220 --> 22:41.280
it's all because

22:41.300 --> 22:43.230
the Second Prince set me up.

22:43.250 --> 22:45.870
[Fan's Residence]

22:48.220 --> 22:50.280
Anyway, this is what happened.

22:50.300 --> 22:52.540
He didn't know about the prostitution
in the Baoyue Pleasure House.

22:53.660 --> 22:54.680
Father, you heard him.

22:54.700 --> 22:56.460
I truly had no idea about that.

22:56.860 --> 22:58.760
If the Baoyue Pleasure House
were to be exposed,

22:58.780 --> 23:00.440
you would be the first one under arrest.

23:00.460 --> 23:01.480
Please, Father.

23:01.500 --> 23:02.820
They didn't tell me it was a brothel.

23:02.820 --> 23:04.700
They said it was just a place
for listening to songs and chatting.

23:04.700 --> 23:05.780
I...

23:06.580 --> 23:08.100
What should we do, then?

23:13.020 --> 23:14.300
Actually,

23:15.500 --> 23:18.620
this can be over
if I compromise or yield.

23:18.780 --> 23:19.760
That's impossible.

23:19.780 --> 23:21.000
Aunt, do you trust me so much?

23:21.020 --> 23:23.020
You have never compromised or yielded.

23:23.500 --> 23:26.020
Have you come up
with a solution for Sizhe?

23:26.040 --> 23:27.820
Making a clear break
with the Baoyue Pleasure House

23:27.820 --> 23:29.760
within a short time

23:29.780 --> 23:30.980
isn't realistic.

23:31.020 --> 23:32.700
To keep him safe,

23:33.020 --> 23:34.740
he has to leave the Capital.

23:39.340 --> 23:40.580
You are right.

23:41.060 --> 23:43.240
I will accompany Sizhe
and hide in Danzhou for a while.

23:43.260 --> 23:44.980
He can't stay in the Qing State.

23:45.580 --> 23:47.220
Where else could he go, then?

23:48.180 --> 23:49.300
Head northward.

23:49.340 --> 23:50.540
Go to Northern Qi.

23:50.940 --> 23:52.540
That's too far away.

23:53.500 --> 23:54.580
That's good.

23:55.180 --> 23:57.020
I will accompany Sizhe
to go to the north.

23:57.260 --> 23:59.200
Aunt, you can't go with him.
He has to go there alone.

23:59.220 --> 24:00.040
Why not?

24:00.060 --> 24:00.960
Why?

24:00.980 --> 24:02.680
This is a secret move,

24:02.700 --> 24:04.380
not a vacation.

24:04.780 --> 24:06.720
You are the daughter
of the duke after all.

24:06.740 --> 24:08.780
Everyone knows your face.

24:08.820 --> 24:11.080
Still, Sizhe can't go
to Northern Qi alone.

24:11.100 --> 24:13.020
He has never left the Capital before.

24:20.260 --> 24:21.500
Fan Sizhe.

24:24.060 --> 24:25.260
Are you afraid?

24:25.660 --> 24:26.740
A bit.

24:27.300 --> 24:28.380
I know

24:28.500 --> 24:30.100
it's very difficult for you

24:30.780 --> 24:32.500
to suddenly leave a comfortable home

24:32.500 --> 24:34.420
and go on a long
and unknown journey alone

24:34.420 --> 24:35.220
without help.

24:35.220 --> 24:36.440
Stop... Stop saying.

24:36.460 --> 24:38.060
You are making me more scared.

24:38.100 --> 24:39.960
But this is also an opportunity for you.

24:39.980 --> 24:42.020
How is this an opportunity?

24:42.260 --> 24:44.820
One will never grow up
if they don't leave home.

24:46.220 --> 24:49.380
Have you ever thought
of proving yourself to someone?

24:50.700 --> 24:53.300
To prove that you are not a kid anymore.

24:53.500 --> 24:54.580
To prove

24:55.340 --> 24:57.780
that not everything you do is wrong.

24:58.500 --> 25:01.180
And to prove
that you deserve expectations.

25:04.940 --> 25:06.300
I want to prove myself.

25:06.500 --> 25:07.780
Go to the north, then.

25:08.100 --> 25:09.780
Find your own path.

25:10.020 --> 25:11.540
He can't do this.

25:12.260 --> 25:13.340
All right.

25:17.980 --> 25:19.220
Louder.

25:19.460 --> 25:20.040
All right.

25:20.060 --> 25:21.440
I can't hear you.

25:21.460 --> 25:22.860
I can do this!

25:25.180 --> 25:26.360
I made a mistake,

25:26.380 --> 25:27.840
so I must bear the consequences.

25:27.860 --> 25:29.020
Father,

25:29.220 --> 25:30.740
I will go to Northern Qi.

25:32.020 --> 25:34.060
But you have fear.

25:34.500 --> 25:35.580
Mother,

25:36.100 --> 25:37.580
I do have fear.

25:38.260 --> 25:40.700
But I can't always stand behind you.

25:41.500 --> 25:43.020
I have already grown all up.

25:43.660 --> 25:45.020
When should he depart?

25:46.700 --> 25:47.760
Tonight.

25:47.780 --> 25:48.560
So soon?

25:48.580 --> 25:49.960
The sooner, the better, Mother.

25:49.980 --> 25:52.500
I'm afraid I might change my mind
a few days later.

25:52.740 --> 25:55.160
Xian, is the weather in Northern Qi
very cold?

25:55.180 --> 25:55.760
It's quite cold.

25:55.780 --> 25:58.480
All right. I will go get
some more thick clothes.

25:58.500 --> 26:00.060
I'm running out of time.

26:07.460 --> 26:10.460
How come he just changed
all of a sudden?

26:10.660 --> 26:11.820
Aunt,

26:11.940 --> 26:15.060
sometimes, it only takes a moment
for a man to grow up.

26:17.100 --> 26:19.620
No, I must remind him something.

26:29.540 --> 26:31.380
This is sudden.

26:32.500 --> 26:33.840
In the end,

26:33.860 --> 26:35.400
I got him involved in this.

26:35.420 --> 26:37.340
You were right.

26:38.500 --> 26:39.580
What?

26:39.660 --> 26:42.820
It takes only a moment for a man
to grow up.

26:46.580 --> 26:49.500
Destiny always strikes us unprepared.

26:50.740 --> 26:52.740
This brat doesn't disappoint me.

26:53.860 --> 26:55.620
That's my son.

27:02.260 --> 27:03.620
You should say this

27:04.260 --> 27:06.380
to him in person.

27:13.700 --> 27:15.760
Remember to dress warmly
when the weather is cold.

27:15.780 --> 27:17.620
Don't skip meals.

27:17.780 --> 27:19.020
All right, Mother.

27:19.060 --> 27:19.780
Don't see me off.

27:19.780 --> 27:21.240
I would change my mind and stay.

27:21.260 --> 27:22.340
Well, then.

27:23.460 --> 27:24.700
All right, stop crying.

27:24.700 --> 27:26.540
You will get wrinkles.

27:26.820 --> 27:28.540
Bite your tongue.

27:30.580 --> 27:31.860
I'm leaving, Mother.

27:52.580 --> 27:53.660
Father.

27:57.820 --> 27:59.520
Fan Xian said

27:59.540 --> 28:02.540
I should tell you this in person.

28:05.740 --> 28:07.340
The carriage is ready.

28:12.060 --> 28:13.540
Thank you, Father.

28:14.780 --> 28:16.060
One more thing.

28:20.300 --> 28:22.060
You didn't let me down.

28:22.780 --> 28:24.380
Fan Sizhe,

28:24.820 --> 28:26.620
you are my son.

28:28.420 --> 28:29.820
Safe journey.

28:30.260 --> 28:31.740
Your mother and I

28:33.260 --> 28:34.740
will wait for you to come home.

29:32.060 --> 29:33.340
What are you looking at?

29:36.460 --> 29:37.740
I'm looking at the rain.

29:39.700 --> 29:41.980
I grew up in the Capital.

29:43.260 --> 29:45.220
I have seen all kinds of rain,

29:45.500 --> 29:47.060
and I'm fed up of them.

29:49.420 --> 29:51.020
Somehow, I couldn't stop looking

29:51.500 --> 29:53.540
at the rain today.

29:56.260 --> 29:58.860
Just consider that the Capital is crying

29:58.940 --> 30:00.460
to send you off.

30:09.260 --> 30:10.620
Why don't you cry it out?

30:13.260 --> 30:14.540
I don't want to.

30:15.020 --> 30:16.240
I'm a grown-up now.

30:16.260 --> 30:17.620
Grown-ups don't cry.

30:17.740 --> 30:19.300
They do cry.

30:20.340 --> 30:21.860
Sometimes, grown-ups

30:22.020 --> 30:23.700
can be a crier.

30:24.780 --> 30:27.540
Xian, let's cry together.

30:30.180 --> 30:31.020
I'm not going northward.

30:31.020 --> 30:32.260
Why should I cry?

30:34.260 --> 30:36.300
Can't you speak anything nicer?

30:38.420 --> 30:39.500
What is this?

30:44.540 --> 30:45.780
Bank notes?

30:47.100 --> 30:48.980
Well... Are these all mine?

30:50.740 --> 30:51.520
This is the capital.

30:51.540 --> 30:52.840
Once you arrive in Northern Qi,

30:52.860 --> 30:54.860
your first mission is to make money.

30:55.860 --> 30:57.280
You decide what business you want.

30:57.300 --> 30:59.000
If anything happens,
you take care of it.

30:59.020 --> 31:00.760
Don't forget you want to prove to Father

31:00.780 --> 31:01.540
and yourself.

31:01.540 --> 31:03.060
I know. Don't worry about me.

31:03.120 --> 31:05.000
Don't forget to return the money to me.

31:05.300 --> 31:06.360
This is an investment.

31:06.380 --> 31:08.340
If you make profits,
I will take dividends.

31:09.020 --> 31:10.060
We are brothers.

31:10.060 --> 31:11.100
Do we have to keep it strictly business?

31:11.100 --> 31:12.020
If you say so, give me back the money.

31:12.020 --> 31:12.760
No...

31:12.780 --> 31:13.440
Don't worry.

31:13.460 --> 31:15.220
I will make sure you get dividends.

31:17.580 --> 31:20.060
You say this is my first mission.

31:20.100 --> 31:21.980
What about the second mission?

31:22.460 --> 31:24.180
Do you still remember Guo Baokun?

31:25.100 --> 31:26.460
He's also in Northern Qi.

31:28.460 --> 31:29.640
No way.

31:29.660 --> 31:30.640
What do you mean?

31:30.660 --> 31:32.440
You beat him up to a pulp.

31:32.460 --> 31:34.000
Do you still have to go hard on him?

31:34.020 --> 31:35.780
He is working for me now.

31:36.420 --> 31:38.100
Seriously?

31:38.120 --> 31:39.320
Once you arrive in Northern Qi,

31:39.340 --> 31:41.320
look for Guo Baokun immediately.

31:41.340 --> 31:42.320
And then?

31:42.340 --> 31:45.180
Remember what I'm going to tell you.

31:45.420 --> 31:47.020
Keep it between us.

31:49.300 --> 31:51.020
Can I tell Guo Baokun about it?

31:53.300 --> 31:54.860
Keep it between you and I.

31:55.660 --> 31:56.700
You need to be precise.

31:56.700 --> 31:57.780
Pipe down.

32:20.820 --> 32:22.080
I'm counting on you, guys.

32:22.100 --> 32:23.740
Please don't say that, Inspector.

32:26.300 --> 32:28.160
They will be escorting you to the north.

32:28.180 --> 32:29.520
They will look after you on the way.

32:29.540 --> 32:31.000
Who are they?

32:31.020 --> 32:32.520
Don't forget what I told you.

32:32.540 --> 32:34.540
Safe journey. Go ahead.

32:37.020 --> 32:39.300
Please take care of my mother.

32:39.460 --> 32:41.620
Don't worry. I have got it.

32:42.780 --> 32:43.980
Thank you, Xian.

32:55.020 --> 32:56.680
I will remember the money you gave me.

32:56.700 --> 32:57.440
Rest assured.

32:57.460 --> 32:58.780
I will make profits.

33:19.820 --> 33:21.180
Don't worry.

33:22.260 --> 33:24.740
Those are the skilled fighters
from the Fourth Division.

33:24.780 --> 33:26.380
Your brother will be fine.

33:26.580 --> 33:27.700
Thank you.

33:27.820 --> 33:29.100
Don't thank me.

33:29.700 --> 33:31.460
If it weren't
for Mr. Chen's instruction,

33:31.700 --> 33:33.780
I couldn't care less about you.

33:39.960 --> 33:41.960
I will start my new post
in the First Division tomorrow.

33:41.980 --> 33:43.620
Do you want to come and take a look?

33:53.150 --> 33:55.470
[Imperial courtyard,
Lin Wan'er's residence]

34:02.940 --> 34:04.100
Fan Xian, right?

34:04.180 --> 34:05.300
Ye Ling'er.

34:05.780 --> 34:07.360
Looks like I have to refine
my light body skills.

34:07.380 --> 34:08.260
- Hurry over.
- Where is Wan'er?

34:08.260 --> 34:09.320
I have something to tell you.

34:09.340 --> 34:10.780
What is it about? Where is Wan'er?

34:10.780 --> 34:12.620
Don't deflect. I'm forgetful.

34:12.780 --> 34:14.340
[Ye Ling'er, daughter of Ye Zhong]
Wan'er knew you would come,

34:14.340 --> 34:16.120
[the Grand Commandant of the Capital]
so she hid away.

34:16.140 --> 34:18.700
Why is Wan'er avoiding me?

34:21.340 --> 34:22.940
She wants me to tell you this.

34:23.740 --> 34:26.320
First, Wan'er knows you love her
very much.

34:26.340 --> 34:27.560
So does she.

34:27.580 --> 34:29.560
Second, because of the first point,

34:29.580 --> 34:31.720
she's worried about you
as you might face dangers

34:31.740 --> 34:33.680
after you just got back here.

34:33.700 --> 34:36.940
She hopes you can focus
on dealing with them.

34:37.180 --> 34:39.760
Third, because of the first two points,

34:39.780 --> 34:41.680
you shouldn't come here.

34:41.700 --> 34:43.580
She won't meet you for now.

34:45.220 --> 34:46.940
Did Wan'er say all this?

34:47.820 --> 34:49.940
This is my interpretation
of what she said.

34:51.380 --> 34:52.580
She said

34:52.980 --> 34:54.380
you would understand her.

35:03.240 --> 35:04.580
There is one more thing.

35:06.380 --> 35:07.660
What is that again?

35:09.980 --> 35:11.140
She said

35:11.340 --> 35:12.860
she would always be with you.

35:18.599 --> 35:19.679
I know.

35:24.980 --> 35:26.240
Could you please

35:26.260 --> 35:27.940
relay a message to her?

35:29.060 --> 35:30.580
Sure, go on.

35:34.260 --> 35:35.340
First,

35:36.140 --> 35:37.220
I miss you.

35:38.300 --> 35:39.380
Second,

35:40.060 --> 35:41.260
don't worry.

35:42.260 --> 35:43.340
Why aren't you making notes?

35:43.340 --> 35:45.200
It's short. I can remember.

35:45.220 --> 35:46.300
Right.

35:47.260 --> 35:48.620
You may leave.

36:12.820 --> 36:14.420
I really don't get you.

36:14.580 --> 36:16.400
Just meet with him if you want to.

36:16.420 --> 36:18.900
Why are you standing here
with those dewy eyes of yours?

36:22.060 --> 36:23.580
Given the current situation,

36:23.980 --> 36:26.380
he should focus on his problem.

36:29.620 --> 36:31.180
I fear I would keep him

36:31.780 --> 36:33.100
after meeting him.

36:33.100 --> 36:35.920
[Lin Wan'er, daughter
of Prime Minster Lin Ruofu]

36:37.820 --> 36:39.580
I envy you two so much.

36:40.940 --> 36:42.460
I won't have such luck

36:42.740 --> 36:44.620
in my life.

36:45.900 --> 36:46.840
Ling'er,

36:46.860 --> 36:49.440
if you can't accept the marriage
appointed by His Majesty,

36:49.460 --> 36:51.880
let's go to the palace tomorrow
and implore His Majesty

36:51.900 --> 36:53.140
to annul it.

36:53.420 --> 36:55.300
My father won't agree with that.

36:55.340 --> 36:56.320
I have made up my mind.

36:56.340 --> 36:57.760
I would rather just take my life.

36:57.780 --> 36:59.900
Please don't.

37:01.780 --> 37:04.420
My family is already preparing
for the engagement.

37:04.460 --> 37:06.180
I'm really upset seeing that.

37:06.980 --> 37:08.660
Can I stay at your place

37:08.860 --> 37:10.300
for a few days?

37:12.260 --> 37:15.060
You can stay here as long as you want.

37:45.180 --> 37:46.260
Father.

37:49.700 --> 37:50.820
I'm back.

37:57.740 --> 37:59.300
Which cell are you in?

38:01.100 --> 38:02.340
I'm all right now.

38:03.780 --> 38:05.420
I came to fetch you home.

38:11.540 --> 38:12.980
Good to know that.

38:13.460 --> 38:14.620
You may go.

38:15.340 --> 38:16.860
I'm doing pretty well here.

38:17.340 --> 38:18.500
I'm not going back.

38:54.860 --> 38:56.580
Have you ever considered

38:56.940 --> 39:00.100
the consequence of helping Fan Xian
fake his death?

39:03.340 --> 39:04.900
Fan Xian went to the palace

39:05.140 --> 39:07.460
and confessed to his crime
of deceiving the emperor.

39:09.220 --> 39:11.220
You do know that, huh?

39:15.340 --> 39:16.740
This crime

39:17.260 --> 39:20.040
often brings destruction

39:20.060 --> 39:21.620
to the whole clan.

39:21.780 --> 39:23.700
Why am I here?

39:23.940 --> 39:25.700
Do you think I'm putting on a show?

39:28.260 --> 39:30.620
I'm preparing to pay myself
for you what did.

39:30.660 --> 39:31.560
I sorted it out.

39:31.580 --> 39:33.740
At worst, I would take my life
to spare the family.

39:34.340 --> 39:36.340
You sorted it out, you say?

39:38.780 --> 39:40.040
Can you sort out

39:40.060 --> 39:42.300
the laws of the Qing State
and His Majesty's mind?

39:42.320 --> 39:44.760
If anything were to go wrong,
I would take the blame all by myself.

39:44.780 --> 39:46.900
Do you think so highly of yourself

39:47.060 --> 39:48.640
that you would sacrifice your own life

39:48.660 --> 39:50.080
and end everything?

39:50.100 --> 39:51.600
That was a desperate choice.

39:51.620 --> 39:52.920
Just how desperate were you

39:52.940 --> 39:55.300
that you wouldn't consider
the consequences?

39:56.260 --> 39:58.340
It concerns a prince's treason.

39:58.540 --> 40:00.180
You could've returned
to the Capital first.

40:00.200 --> 40:02.700
It was related to the Qing State,
and I couldn't just sit tight.

40:04.780 --> 40:06.100
In that case,

40:06.300 --> 40:08.200
did you do that for the Qing State?

40:08.220 --> 40:09.740
This is the very reason

40:09.780 --> 40:10.960
for what I have done so far.

40:10.980 --> 40:13.440
You would rather deceive the emperor
for the sake of the Qing State?

40:13.460 --> 40:14.700
The state is beyond everything.

40:14.700 --> 40:15.600
What about His Majesty?

40:15.620 --> 40:18.060
His Majesty would certainly care
about the state, but...

40:22.780 --> 40:25.740
But he can't be more important
than the state itself.

40:26.620 --> 40:28.420
How dare you, Yan Bingyun!

40:28.420 --> 40:29.720
You taught me this.

40:29.740 --> 40:31.220
The state is above all else.

41:10.460 --> 41:12.260
At least you are cautious

41:12.660 --> 41:14.300
when you say things

41:14.380 --> 41:15.940
like that.

41:20.620 --> 41:22.180
I'm not that dull.

41:25.900 --> 41:26.980
Come.

41:40.300 --> 41:41.900
I doubt it.

41:45.660 --> 41:47.260
Why did you help him?

41:47.820 --> 41:49.300
I didn't help him.

41:49.820 --> 41:51.180
I did it for the Qing State.

41:51.900 --> 41:53.700
But you were assisting him.

41:54.180 --> 41:55.260
Yes.

41:55.780 --> 41:56.940
He may be

41:57.180 --> 41:58.900
ridiculous,

41:59.140 --> 42:00.220
but

42:00.460 --> 42:02.140
he is bold.

42:03.380 --> 42:04.780
So

42:04.980 --> 42:06.780
you are willing to advise him?

42:08.660 --> 42:10.300
Why would I advise him?

42:14.460 --> 42:16.220
He probably will

42:16.740 --> 42:19.100
take over the Imperial Inspectorate
in the future.

42:20.780 --> 42:22.780
Mr. Chen is irreplaceable.

42:26.260 --> 42:27.780
We are getting old.

42:30.460 --> 42:31.980
Does Mr. Chen intend to retire?

42:36.420 --> 42:37.980
It's not just Chen Pingping.

42:39.460 --> 42:40.780
I wish to retire too.

42:41.520 --> 42:43.480
It's time to hand
the Imperial Inspectorate

42:43.580 --> 42:45.700
to youngsters like you all.

42:48.540 --> 42:50.260
Your retirement doesn't matter.

42:50.300 --> 42:52.340
However, Mr. Chen cannot retire.

42:53.340 --> 42:54.640
What are you saying?

42:54.660 --> 42:57.740
No one in the Imperial Inspectorate
is as important as Mr. Chen.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
